  "name": "Golden Aioli",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "Golden aioli is a creamy, tangy sauce with a hint of sweetness that comes together in just minutes. Use as a spread for sandwiches, a dip for fries and vegetables, or serve as a side for grilled meats and seafood.",
